          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "डोलना (ḍolnā) is a tadbhava, inherited from Sanskrit dōlāyatē, \"moves to and fro\" (CDIAL 6585). CDIAL gives the Hindi verb as \"to oscillate\"."
            }
